        <activityName xml:lang="en">Deinking emulsion, in paper production, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Deinking emulsion, in paper production, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of deinking emulsion. Very large uncertainty of the process data, as only a mixture of different materials is included.;
UUID: ac2489ce-6796-3563-9e18-4795b10e1d2f
Mixture of hydrogen peroxide, sodium hydroxide, silica and fatty acid. Only input of mentioned substances is taken into account.
Location: Data used has no specific geographical origin (average from different indications in literature). Data are used as European average data.
Technology: mixture of different substances without any further inputs/outputs
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: see technology 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ac2489ce-6796-3563-9e18-4795b10e1d2f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
